# Sorter live files

Sorter configuration that grouping **reads** (it does not overwrite catalogs). Paths via `shared.paths`. Sorter DB: `database/order-grouping-sorter/` — `taxonomy_picklists.csv` (Hashim #038) and `fixed_batches.csv` (B80/B100/… criteria).

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `database/order-grouping-sorter/taxonomy_picklists.csv` | Closed pick-lists. New products pick from these values. Do not invent. |
| `database/order-grouping-sorter/fixed_batches.csv` | Fixed batch codes + match criteria. Source for sorter `B80`/`B100`/… naming. |
| `database/order-grouping-sorter/leftover_batches/{YYYY-MM-DD}.csv` | Leftover `B1`/`B2`… criteria for that run date (same columns as fixed). Written each sorter run; overwritten that day. |
| `database/order-grouping-sorter/catalog_cache/*.pkl` | Plain/Packs index cache (`sorter_catalog_cache_path`). Rebuild when source file mtime/size changes. Not committed. |
| `database/shared/custom_label/Custom_Label_Database (Areeb).csv` | Printed finish for grouping (temporary, locked 2026-10-09). After first dash → Custom Label; no-dash SKU → whole Custom Label. Four Areeb columns are filled here. Live NocoDB export stays `Custom_Label_Database.csv` for other apps. |
| `database/shared/plain/Plain Database.csv` | Plain finish (till last dash or whole SKU → SKU) |
| `database/shared/packs/Packs Database.csv` | Plain finish (whole SKU → Channel Child SKU) |
| `config/ShipStation/.env` | Shared ShipStation `REAL_API_*` |
| `Order Grouping Sorter/Logs/` | Dry-run reports |
| `Order Packing List Generator/Input/{DD-MM-YYYY}/{nth} Shift/` | Write target on `--run` (`sorter_input_csv_path`). Nth `--run` of the day = nth shift (locked 2026-10-14). Replaces CSVs in that shift folder only. Fixed-batch files are `B100-{6 fields}.csv` / `B80-{6 fields}.csv` / … ; leftover `B1-{6 fields}.csv` / `B2-…` (skip reserved). `RESEND` / `UNMATCHED` land there. 3rd shift and later: overdue, blank, and the run-day ship-by, plus tag `1004- Personalised Design-Ready-` when ship-by is later (locked 2026-10-22). A later ship-by without that tag stays out. |
| `Order Grouping Sorter/Manually Made Files/` | Historical floor exports + Packing output. **Analysis only** — not an intake source. |

Do not import Packing internals. CSV columns copy `CSV_FIELDNAMES` in Packing `orders_to_csv.py`.
